  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial Panel_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0de040b7d7397744b9dfca391e313b5e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 459586355200
    m_Localized: PUT THE TAPE ON THE RIGHT SHELF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715328
    m_Localized: "Each VHS tape belongs to a specific subgenre. Look closely at the
      cover, title, and sticker \u2014 they'll give you clues about where the tape
      belongs.\n\nIdentify the subgenre, find the matching shelf, and put the tape
      in its place.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715329
    m_Localized: WATCH THE TAPE ON THE VCR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715330
    m_Localized: "Not sure which subgenre a tape belongs to? Put it in the VCR and
      watch a short clip \u2014 it will give you an extra clue to help identify the
      tape's subgenre."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715331
    m_Localized: ANSWER THE PHONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715332
    m_Localized: "When the phone rings, pick it up and talk to the customer. After
      the call, they'll return a VHS tape to the store \u2014 and sometimes leave
      a gift for you too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715333
    m_Localized: CHECK THE RETURN BOX
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715334
    m_Localized: After a call, the customer will leave a returned VHS tape in the
      box by the door. Sometimes, they'll leave a gift next to it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715335
    m_Localized: DECORATE THE STORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715336
    m_Localized: "Use the gifts you've received from customers to decorate the store.
      When you pick up a gift, its spot will be highlighted \u2014 take it there
      and put it in place.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715337
    m_Localized: 'CHANGE THE MUSIC

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 459615715338
    m_Localized: 'The audio cassettes you find will appear on the shelf above the
      cassette player. Choose a cassette from the shelf, then press Play on the player
      to listen to it and change the music in the store.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
